66 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (The application was built using Python Flask for the backend, SQLite for the database, HTML templates for the interface, and CSS for basic styling. Users must register with a valid username and a strong password. After logging in, each user can add notes that are saved in the database and displayed only to that user. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
