/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 54 0 R
/T (3. Attacks Performed  3.1 SQL Injection Attack  A SQL Injection attack was tested by entering a malicious username such as ' OR '1'='1 in the login form. The purpose of this attack was to trick the database into bypassing authentication by changing the  meaning of the SQL query. )
/E (3. Attacks Performed  3.1 SQL Injection Attack  A SQL Injection attack was tested by entering a malicious username such as ' OR '1'='1 in the login form. The purpose of this attack was to trick the database into bypassing authentication by changing the  meaning of the SQL query. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
