71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 54 0 R
/T (Password hashing: User passwords are not stored in plain text. The application uses bcrypt to hash passwords before saving them in the database.  Server-side validation: Usernames and passwords are validated on the server, not only in the browser.  Notes are also limited to valid length.  SQL Injection protection: Database operations use parameterized queries with placeholders instead of  directly inserting user input into SQL statements.  XSS protection: The application uses Flask/Jinja autoescaping so that user-submitted note content is  displayed as text instead of executable HTML or JavaScript.  Login attempt limitation: The system locks an account temporarily after repeated failed login attempts  to reduce brute-force and dictionary attack risk. )
/E (Password hashing: User passwords are not stored in plain text. The application uses bcrypt to hash passwords before saving them in the database.  Server-side validation: Usernames and passwords are validated on the server, not only in the browser.  Notes are also limited to valid length.  SQL Injection protection: Database operations use parameterized queries with placeholders instead of  directly inserting user input into SQL statements.  XSS protection: The application uses Flask/Jinja autoescaping so that user-submitted note content is  displayed as text instead of executable HTML or JavaScript.  Login attempt limitation: The system locks an account temporarily after repeated failed login attempts  to reduce brute-force and dictionary attack risk. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
