/T (3.2 Cross-Site Scripting \(XSS\) Attack  AstoredXSSattackwastested by adding a note containing a script payload such as <script>alert\('XSS'\)</script>. The goal of this attack was to make the browser execute JavaScript when the note is displayed. )
/E (3.2 Cross-Site Scripting \(XSS\) Attack  AstoredXSSattackwastested by adding a note containing a script payload such as <script>alert\('XSS'\)</script>. The goal of this attack was to make the browser execute JavaScript when the note is displayed. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
