/T (7. Conclusion  Thisprojectdemonstrated how a basic web application can be built and secured against common vulnerabilities. The testing showed that SQL Injection and XSS attacks can be prevented through parameterized queries and output escaping. The brute-force and dictionary attack tests showed the importance of login attempt limits and strong password policies. Overall, the project improved understanding of secure coding, ethical hacking, vulnerability testing, and professional security documentation. )
/E (7. Conclusion  Thisprojectdemonstrated how a basic web application can be built and secured against common vulnerabilities. The testing showed that SQL Injection and XSS attacks can be prevented through parameterized queries and output escaping. The brute-force and dictionary attack tests showed the importance of login attempt limits and strong password policies. Overall, the project improved understanding of secure coding, ethical hacking, vulnerability testing, and professional security documentation. )
